BT 1 0 0 1 5 163 Tm (UI and business logic are mixed) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 163 Tm (The frame performs validation, payment and SQL work. Changes to payment rules require editing GUI code; unit testing is difficult.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 143.5 Tm (Action command comparison) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 143.5 Tm (Using == to compare Strings checks object identity, not text. Use "Pay".equals\(e.getActionCommand\(\)\) or separate listeners.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 124 Tm (No input validation) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 124 Tm (Empty registration number, non-numeric amount, zero or negative amount can cause exceptions or invalid payments.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 104.5 Tm (Blocking database call / sleep) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 104.5 Tm (Database access and Thread.sleep\(3000\) run on the Swing event-dispatch thread \(EDT\). The window freezes and cannot repaint or respond.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 85 Tm (Poor feedback) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 85 Tm (Printing Paid to the console does not clearly tell the receptionist/student whether payment succeeded or failed.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 65.5 Tm (Receipt button has no defined action) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 65.5 Tm (A Receipt button that is not handled cannot display or print a receipt.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 46 Tm (SQL injection risk) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 46 Tm (Concatenating user input into SQL permits malformed input and SQL injection. Use PreparedStatement.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 26.5 Tm (Resources are not closed) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 26.5 Tm (Connections/statements may remain open; the window close operation and database cleanup are not handled.) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 5 7 Tm (Exceptions are ignored or mishandled) Tj T* ET
BT 1 0 0 1 112.7165 7 Tm (SQLException, NumberFormatException and InterruptedException need safe handling and user-facing messages.) Tj T* ET
